                    "searchText": "Source Stock Sourcing filters eligibility before ranking candidate warehouses/pools; physical stock alone does not make an item sellable in a zone. Choose eligible fulfillment sources for a request. Know Storefront context, requested product/unit/quantity, service area, and warehouse policy. Inventory sourcing policy Platform Capabilities Flow Verify context and requested quantity/unit. Filter by tenant, enterprise, country, zone/area, Store, channel, segment, purpose, product sellability, warehouse state, and capacity. Calculate available-to-sell per source. Rank explicit priority, distance/cost/service policy, split policy, and fallback. Return selected sources with bounded explanation or no-source outcome."
