                    "kind": "paragraph",
                    "text": "First decide whether behavior belongs to the reusable framework, a business capability, a customer project, deployment topology, tenant configuration, or governed runtime state. Only then choose a schema, service, facade, controller, router, pipeline, interceptor, event, search, utility, data, or test file."
