            "searchText": "Create and Identify Products Create stable product identity first, then variants and relationships; prices and stock reference that identity but remain separately owned. Create a product and variants with stable identity. Know catalog, type, attributes, units, categories, and lifecycle. Product capability Platform Capabilities Steps Select tenant, enterprise, staged catalog, product type, and stable code. Add names, descriptions, categories, classifications, attributes, units, media references, and lifecycle. Define variant dimensions and stable variant codes without embedding price or balance. Validate required data and relationships, start approval workflow, and publish the approved version. Verify Online product, search projection, cache refresh, and unresolved Price/Stock behavior.",
