                "searchText": "Configure and Operate Pricing Configure price lists and groups, publish approved prices, and inspect safe resolution provenance when a result is missing or unexpected. Create price structures and diagnose contextual resolution. Know product identity, scopes, currency, units, quantity, and effective dates. Pricing capability Platform Capabilities Operate Create lists/groups and assign enterprise, Site, Store, country, channel, segment, customer, currency, and priority scopes. Create product/variant prices with unit, quantity tier, effective dates, and active state. Detect ambiguous overlaps before approval. Publish exact staged versions to Online and invalidate bounded cache keys. Monitor resolution latency, misses, ambiguity, stale projections, currency/unit failures, and cache effects. Troubleshoot Confirm trusted context and effective time. List eligible groups/lists and exclusion reasons. Compare priority and specificity without exposing restricted contract prices. Reconcile Online, cache, and source version after partial publication."
