                "searchText": "Transfer Stock A transfer coordinates paired movements and durable in-transit state rather than directly rewriting two balances. Move stock between governed locations with in-transit state and recovery. Know source/destination, quantity/unit, permissions, and logistics references. Inventory capability Platform Capabilities Lifecycle Request and validate source/destination eligibility. Reserve or deduct source according to policy and create in-transit state. Dispatch, receive partially or fully, reject, cancel, or mark exception. Create destination receipt and close only after reconciliation. Use idempotency, revisions, audit, timeout, loss/damage compensation, and cache invalidation."
