            "sourceHash": "d4cc441ad083e8e4d16e8ed5310a27c23772e2ef271948a9d9ff09b21e9f6802",
            "searchText": "Reserve Stock A reservation temporarily reduces available-to-sell under tenant-safe ownership, expiry, concurrency, and idempotency rules. Create, extend, consume, release, or expire a reservation safely. Know trusted context, product/variant, requested quantity/unit, source, owner, and expiry policy. Inventory capability Platform Capabilities Flow Resolve eligible sources and current availability. Create reservation with stable owner/reference, source, quantity/unit, expiry, revision, and idempotency key. Prevent oversell through atomic or qualified concurrency behavior. Consume into allocation, release explicitly, or expire through governed job/event processing. Persist evidence and invalidate affected availability cache after commit.",
